  storyText: "Mirage's Fear\n\nMirage, quietly: \"They don't want to send me home. They want to use me as a key. Once the gate is open, they won't need me anymore.\"\n\n1. Trust the Voodoo Boys anyway.\n2. Tell Celestine what Mirage said.\n3. Sneak out of the church."
